on January 10, 2017, after winning the November 2016 general election.","extract_html":"<p><b>Regina Inez Hinojosa</b> is an American lawyer and politician who is the Democratic nominee for the 2026 Texas gubernatorial election. Hinojosa is a member of the Texas House of Representatives, representing the 49th district. She is a member of the Democratic Party and was sworn into the Texas House on January 10, 2017, after winning the November 2016 general election.</p>"}